de57b4e2f2a9END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_GLO_GeneralLoreBook_WallOfTheFaithless</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GLO_GeneralLoreBook_WallOfTheFaithless\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GLO_GeneralLoreBook_WallOfTheFaithless\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">517532d1-e1c4-4c89-ae0e-2b191c3e3b5b</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:517532d1-e1c4-4c89-ae0e-2b191c3e3b5b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:517532d1-e1c4-4c89-ae0e-2b191c3e3b5b\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_of_Books\" title=\"Stack of Books\">Stack of Books</a> atop a display case in the Archive of the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-6537&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;2904</span></li>\n<li>In a <a href=\"/wiki/Row_of_Books\" title=\"Row of Books\">Row of Books</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Szarr_Palace\" title=\"Szarr Palace\">Szarr Palace Ramparts</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-71&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-21</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>At the core of the Fugue Plane's barren ash-gray wasteland stands the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/City_of_Judgement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"City of Judgement\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/City_of_Judgement\">City of Judgement</a></span> with its Crystal Spire jutting above the streets and the influx of souls.\n</p><p><br>\nThese are godly folk seeing the verdict of those ruling Fugue, their faces hopeful or sullen, their boot heels caked in the mud of peridition. Yet for those who claimed no godly patronage in life, there is only the wall. The wall erected by <a href=\"/wiki/Myrkul\" title=\"Myrkul\">Myrkul</a>, Lord of Bones, to keep those of insubstantial faith from any possible form of peace. See it gored and clawed-at by the desperate, clung with fingernails, flecked with smashed skulls.\n</p><p><br>\nHow Myrkul enjoys his petty torments.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715171014\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1558/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30691/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9789/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 927632/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.164      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   42.164      1 -total\n 49.78%   20.988      7 Template:Icon_text\n 43.85%   18.491     17 Template:Trim\n 21.68%    9.142      2 Template:Uid\n 15.91%    6.710      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.43%    5.663      2 Template:Icon_link\n 12.80%    5.398      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.48%    4.419      7 Template:Ifempty\n 10.20%    4.299      1 Template:Books\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:21709-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715171014 and revision id 242244. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}